# POAM-2026-037 — python:3.12-slim (Debian 13 "trixie") base image OS-package
# CVEs with no upstream/Debian-patched Fixed Version available as of 2026-08-05,
# confirmed via `trivy image --format json` (FixedVersion empty for all entries
# below). These affect the Linux kernel, glibc/util-linux family, perl, gzip,
# ncurses, libacl, and zlib packages shipped in the base image and are not
# introduced by CAGE application code. Re-run `trivy image` against gateway and
# compliance-bridge images after each base-image rebuild; remove entries below
# as soon as a Fixed Version becomes available upstream. Risk accepted via
# POAM-2026-037. Review date: 2026-09-05.
